          <h3 class="text-base mb-2">By Ferry</h3>
          <p class="caption leading-relaxed">International ferries connect Qingdao to Incheon (South Korea) and Shimonoseki (Japan). Domestic ferries run to Dalian and Yantai. The international terminal is at Qingdao Port, about 20 minutes from Old Town by taxi.</p>
