  <!-- Things to Know Before You Go -->
  <section class="section border-t" id="survival"><div class="container">
    <div class="mb-10"><p class="tag mb-3">Things to Know Before You Go</p><h2>What to prepare before your flight</h2><p class="body mt-3 max-w-[65ch]">China is not a destination you can wing. Some things must be set up before you board the plane. Here is the checklist experienced travelers swear by — the stuff generic travel sites gloss over.</p></div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">☎️ SIM Card or eSIM</h4>
        <p class="caption text-xs leading-relaxed">Buy a physical SIM at Qingdao Airport (China Unicom, around ¥100 for 20GB). Alternatively, activate an eSIM (Airalo, Nomad, Holafly) <em>before</em> you leave home. Hotel WiFi in China usually requires a Chinese phone number for SMS verification, so having your own data is essential.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">💰 Alipay &amp; WeChat Pay</h4>
        <p class="caption text-xs leading-relaxed">Download Alipay <em>before</em> your flight. Register with your passport, link a Visa or Mastercard. This is how you pay for everything: street food, taxis, attraction tickets, even toilet paper at public restrooms. Cash is increasingly refused. Set up WeChat Pay as a backup — you will want both.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">🔒 VPN (non-negotiable)</h4>
        <p class="caption text-xs leading-relaxed">Google, Gmail, Instagram, WhatsApp, and most Western sites are blocked in China. Install a VPN on every device before departure. Once you land, VPN websites will be unreachable. ExpressVPN, Astrill, and LetsVPN are the most reliable inside China. Test it at the airport gate <em>before</em> you leave the terminal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">💬 Language Barrier</h4>
        <p class="caption text-xs leading-relaxed">English is limited outside hotel lobbies and major attractions. Download Google Translate with the offline Chinese language pack. Screenshot these key phrases: “Please take me to…” (qing dai wo qu…), “I am allergic to…” (wo dui… guomin), “Where is the toilet?” (cesuo zai nar).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">📄 Visa &amp; Documents</h4>
        <p class="caption text-xs leading-relaxed">Most foreign nationals need a Chinese tourist visa (L) before travel. Qingdao offers 144-hour visa-free transit for eligible countries if you arrive at Qingdao Airport and depart to a third country. Carry printed copies of your hotel bookings and return flight — immigration may ask. <a href="/faq" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline font-medium">Full visa FAQ</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-2">🎒 What to Always Pack</h4>
        <p class="caption text-xs leading-relaxed">Pocket tissues (public toilets rarely have paper), hand sanitizer, Imodium (stomach medicine — hard to find locally), sunscreen (imported brands are rare and expensive in China), a universal power adapter (China uses Type A/C/I), and a portable battery pack for long days out. See the <a href="#packing-section" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline font-medium">packing guide</a> for month-specific items.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 text-center"><a href="/faq" class="btn-primary">Read the complete survival FAQ &rarr;</a></div>
  </div></section>

  
  <!-- Survival Chinese -->
  <section class="section-sm border-t" id="phrases">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mb-8"><p class="tag mb-3">Survival Chinese</p><h2>10 phrases that will save your trip</h2><p class="body mt-3 max-w-[65ch]">English is limited outside hotel lobbies and major attractions. Screenshot this section before your flight. Each phrase below is the one you will actually need — not textbook Chinese.</p></div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">1</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">Where is the toilet?</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="厕所 在 哪儿">Cesuo zai nar? <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Memorize this one. Public restrooms are labeled WC. Carry tissues — most toilets have no paper.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">2</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">I want this one (point at menu)</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="我要这个">Wo yao zhe ge <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">The most useful phrase in any Chinese restaurant. Point at a photo or someone else''s plate and say this.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">3</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">No spicy / very little spicy</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="不要辣 微辣">Bu yao la / wei wei la <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Even dishes not labeled spicy can have chili. Say this when ordering anything. Wei wei la means just a tiny kick.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">4</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">Please take me to (show address)</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="请带我去">Qing dai wo qu... <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">For Didi drivers and taxis. Always have your hotel name and address written in Chinese to show them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">5</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">I am allergic to (peanuts / seafood)</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="我对花生海鲜过敏">Wo dui (hua sheng / hai xian) guo min <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Allergy awareness is limited in China. Learn your allergen in Chinese. Carry an allergy card.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">6</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">Check please / The bill</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="买单">Mai dan <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Say this to get the bill. No tipping in China — it may even be politely refused if you try.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">7</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">I am a foreigner</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="我是外国人">Wo shi wai guo ren <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Useful when someone speaks to you in rapid Chinese. It politely signals you need patience or English.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">8</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">Do you have an English menu?</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="有英文菜单吗">You ying wen cai dan ma? <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Tourist-area restaurants often do. If not, use Google Translate camera mode on the Chinese menu.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">9</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">Too expensive! Cheaper okay?</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="太贵了 便宜一点">Tai gui le! Pian yi yi dian? <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Bargaining is expected at street markets (not in malls or restaurants). Say this with a smile.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold text-xs">10</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-sm">Delicious! / Very good!</p>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-accent)] text-sm mt-0.5" data-speak="好吃 很好">Hao chi! / Hen hao! <button class="speak-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)]/10 transition-colors align-middle -mt-0.5" title="Listen to pronunciation" aria-label="Play pronunciation"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5v4h2l3 3V2L4 5H2z"/><path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 010 5"/><path d="M11 3a6 6 0 010 8"/></svg></button></p>
            <p class="caption text-xs mt-1">Use this constantly. Chinese people appreciate it when foreigners enjoy their food. You will make friends.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
